<title>USA: Balchem sees 1996 sales above $26.5 million.</title>
<headline>Balchem sees 1996 sales above $26.5 million.</headline>
<dateline>SLATE HILL, N.Y. 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Balchem Corp Monday said is expected 1996 sales to exceed $26.5 million, and saw profits near $1.9 million, or about $0.58 per share.  </p>
<p>For the 1995 year, Balchem reported sales of $24.9 million and net income of 1.5 million, or $0.50 per share.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610))</p>
</text>
